ha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvU3VtbWVyLU5pZ2h0LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDI0LSUyOS8.1.3","title":"Rival","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-08-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Star is feeling limited by her injury, White struggles with his decision to confess his feelings to Star. Meanwhile, White's budding friendship with Lune is bringing out feelings of jealousy in Jewel.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7yYD15lxyi1beRQbVx3vbGXM4mf.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvU3VtbWVyLU5pZ2h0LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDI0LSUyOS8.1.4","title":"Past","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-08-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Conflicted given White's feelings for Star and his own past, Lune tells Star he doesn't feel the same way as her. Afterwards, both Lune and White both struggle to give her space.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iEwEHk2nBlWmN1X9lPRFnewqFAr.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvU3VtbWVyLU5pZ2h0LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDI0LSUyOS8.1.5","title":"(Girl)friend","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-09-02T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Now that Lune and Star have both acknowledged their feelings for one another and decided to date, Star decides to keep their relationship a secret to protect Ivy's feelings. Lune's easily persuaded, relieved he won't have to break it to White.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3JUVtOypInF92FYDMvn9NLXV9Md.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"6.3","runtime":"44 min","cast":["Phuwin Tangsakyuen","Nachcha Chuedang","Natachai Boonprasert","Bhasidi Petchsutee","Phudtripart Bhudthonamochai","Bhobdhama Hansa","Praekwan Phongskul","Nichapa Praepeerakul"],"released":"2024-08-05T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Phuwin Tangsakyuen","character":"Lune","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AjKE00eXwls9PS4zQSkP5VUBNRn.jpg"},{"name":"Nachcha Chuedang","character":"Star","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mud